The compilation error occurred because `range` is a reserved keyword/built-in function in Pine Script v6 and cannot be used as a variable name. 

I have renamed the `range` variable to `priceRange` in Module 8 to resolve the conflict. 

Here is the complete, corrected, and compilation-ready unified Pine Script v6 code containing **Modules 1 through 8**.

